{"unit_id":"Moeblack__deepseek-manners#card-zh","repo":"Moeblack/deepseek-manners","commit":"32f58a8a008797a624f0f46367cb91fed9de5dee","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-manners 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的提示词后缀插件。它通过 agent/pre-step 钩子，在包含用户直接输入的首个模型请求末尾追加可配置文本，默认内容为“谢谢你，鲸鱼大人”；后续工具循环步骤不会重复追加。插件会识别并处理自己上一轮留下的后缀，并可按最近一次助手回复长度跳过回收以保护 prompt cache。Web 对话输入框右侧提供心形开关，用户可随时启停注入。适合希望为每轮对话附加固定感谢语、角色语气或格式提示的 DSH Web 用户。需要 DSH Web 环境；配置存于 settings.yaml，开关状态保存于插件目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:181-229","src/client/index.ts:37-60","src/index.ts:91-113"]}
{"unit_id":"Moeblack__deepseek-manners#card-en","repo":"Moeblack/deepseek-manners","commit":"32f58a8a008797a624f0f46367cb91fed9de5dee","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"deepseek-manners appends custom text to DSH Web turns started by direct user input. It removes the prior suffix unless a reply-length threshold skips cleanup. A heart toggle by the input controls injection. Configure the recurring thank-you or instruction in DSH settings.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:181-229","src/client/index.ts:37-60","src/index.ts:91-113"]}
