{"unit_id":"Moeblack__deepseek-manners#feature-3","repo":"Moeblack/deepseek-manners","commit":"32f58a8a008797a624f0f46367cb91fed9de5dee","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-manners 的功能「网页开关」：Web 对话输入框右侧显示心形控件，通过设置端点读取和保存 enabled 状态，用户可控制后缀注入。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:37-60","src/index.ts:151-179"]}
