{"unit_id":"Moeblack__deepseek-manners#caveat-1","repo":"Moeblack/deepseek-manners","commit":"32f58a8a008797a624f0f46367cb91fed9de5dee","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-manners 使用前须知：当最近一次助手回复达到 hideAboveChars 阈值时，插件会跳过旧后缀回收，该后缀可能继续留在后续上下文中。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:197-207"]}
